tinker_cookbook.distillation.train_on_policy:201 [[92mINFO[0m] <|im_system|>system<|im_middle|>You are Kimi, an AI assistant created by Moonshot AI.<|im_end|><|im_user|>user<|im_middle|>Plan a surprise birthday party with a unique theme.<|im_end|><|im_assistant|>assistant<|im_middle|><think></think>Let me craft something delightfully unexpected for you: a **"Midnight in the Library of Lost Things"** party.

