**The Activities:** A "card catalog" where guests draw prompts and spin two-minute tales. A hidden "forbidden section" (photo booth with baroque props). At the witching hour, everyone gathers as the birthday person cracks open a hollowed *secret book* to release cascaded handwritten notes from friends—echoing the library's actual collection of anonymous letters.

**The Menu:** "Spines and Spirits" cocktails named after literary genres. Mystery-flavored macarons in dust jackets. A cake disguised as a stack of vintage books, with one slightly ajar revealing buttercream pages.

